  "description": "Beom-Yun, a cursed prince, weds Chung-Hui, a lame, twice-wed woman used as a living talisman. The jaded prince finds himself consumed by love for this princess, who is nothing more than a pawn in a scramble for power. To protect her, he’ll seize the throne and drown the world in vengeance.\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)",
